    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">For the general purpose, we focus on undirected attributed graphs in this survey. A graph can be represented as G = {V , E} where V denotes the node set { v i } n i =1 and E denotes the edge set { e i } m i =1 .</hasEvidenceText>
