    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To extend Algorithm 1 to the minibatch setting, given a set of input nodes, we rst forward sample the required neighborhood sets (up to depth K )</hasEvidenceText>
