    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the graph convolution operation with binarized weights and node features can be formulated as H ( l +1) H ( l +1) ip = A H ( l ) W ( l )</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
