    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GAT layer learns to weighted combine the embedding (or feature) of its neighborhoods with an attention mechanism, and the attention weights are measured by the local information</hasEvidenceText>
