    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2007.06281_rag::chunk_005</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">As a graph neural layer can work as a low-pass lter</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">H = ( DXW ) , (1) where X R n d is a matrix collecting all vertex features row-wise, W R d q is a matrix of trainable coefcients</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
