    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GCN-LPA still distinguishes the two clusters (Figure 2e ) because it is better at denoising undesirable edges</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
